<title>USA: W. Allis, Wis., $1.205 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>W. Allis, Wis., $1.205 mln won by Cronin &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co. said it won $1.205 million of West Allis, Wis., general obligation taxable promissory notes, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 7.2702 percent.</p>
</text>
